data: {"item_id":"rs_838136","output_index":0,"sequence_number":194,"summary_index":0,"text":"But server never serves project.html; it serves server-side rendered page with its own HTML. Could just rely on that. Simpler: keep server's rendered page; we can ignore project.html.\n\nThus we need to adjust index.html and app.js for consistent IDs.\n\nAlso need to ensure alert visible with text. In index.html we have \u003cdiv id=\"alert\" class=\"hidden\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e. script uses alertDiv.style.display = 'block'; but doesn't set text. Should set innerText to error. In create case missing name: script just displays block but no text. Should display \"Project name is required\". Could modify script to set text.\n\nLet's modify public/static/app.js to match spec.\n\nImplement: use IDs: project-name-input, create-project-btn, project-list. Use alertDiv with id 'alert' and set text.\n\nAlso ensure project rows have data-testid attribute and button text \"Open project\". Already matches.\n\nLet's edit app.js.\n\n","type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done"}

